    "body": "Checking back in on this issue... of the APIs \"Clear-Site-Data talks about\"\r\n\r\n- File System is now standardized 🎉 I just put up #163 to add it to the table\r\n- Web SQL is [being deprecated](https://developer.chrome.com/blog/deprecating-web-sql/#web-sql-deprecation-and-removal-steps)\r\n- AppCache is has now unshipped everywhere\r\n- Plugin data is deprecated and I believe has now unshipped everywhere?\r\n\r\nAre there other APIs we're missing?",
